Package: packetcapture-wifi-tools
Version: 1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, iw, ethtool, iproute2, network-manager, pciutils, usbutils
Maintainer: G. Cragg <gacragg@gmail.com>
Description: Wireless adapter reporting and monitor-mode setup tools
 interfaces.sh reports wireless interface state (driver, mode, channel,
 packet counts, adapter model) in table form.
 wifisetup.sh idempotently configures wireless adapters into monitor mode
 and sets channel/frequency, skipping adapters already configured.
